    "On the Mac, open WiFiDetect › Settings › Wi-Fi and turn on Share readings with iPhone and iPad. Both need to be on the same network." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Mac 上打開「WiFiDetect › 設定 › Wi-Fi」，並開啟「與 iPhone 和 iPad 分享讀數」。兩者需要在同一個網路上。"
